%% alt: State diagram of a notebook cell. An empty cell becomes edited when you type code. Shift+Enter makes it running, shown as In [*]. A running cell ends Done if there is no error or Failed if an exception is raised. Editing a done or failed cell sends it back to edited.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Empty
  Empty --> Edited : type code
  Edited --> Running : Shift+Enter
  Running --> Done : no error
  Running --> Failed : exception
  Failed --> Edited : fix the code
  Done --> Edited : change the code
  Done --> [*]
  note right of Running
    shown as In [*]
    until it finishes
  end note
